### Bifrost SmartRoute REST API Collection
### Can be executed directly in VS Code (REST Client) or IntelliJ HTTP Client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Gateway Health & Metrics Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 2. Standard OpenAI-Compatible Chat Completion (Auto Routing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "smartroute",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Write a thread-safe singleton pattern in Go with sync.Once"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 512,
  "temperature": 0.5
}

### 3. SmartRoute Interactive Playground Route Evaluation (Simple Query)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is the speed of light in vacuum in meters per second?"
}

### 4. SmartRoute Interactive Playground Route Evaluation (Coding Problem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Implement an asynchronous ring buffer queue in Rust using atomic pointers"
}

### 5. SmartRoute Interactive Playground Route Evaluation (Reasoning Challenge)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Prove by contradiction that the square root of 2 is irrational"
}

### 6. List All Registered AI Providers & Circuit Breaker Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/providers
Accept: application/json

### 7. List All Registered Models & Pricing Rates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/models
Accept: application/json

### 8. View Request Logs (Paginated & Filterable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/logs?limit=20&page=1
Accept: application/json

### 9. Filter Request Logs by Category (e.g., coding)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/logs?category=coding&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 10. Simulate Provider Failure (Trips Circuit Breaker)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/failover/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "anthropic",
  "error_code": 503
}

### 11. View Failover Audit Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/failover/events
Accept: application/json

### 12. List Active Routing Rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/rules
Accept: application/json

### 13. Toggle Routing Rule Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/rules/toggle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rule_id": "rule-coding-tier",
  "is_active": true
}

### 14. Get Gateway System Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/settings
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Gateway System Settings
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/smartroute/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseline_model": "gpt-4o",
  "circuit_breaker_threshold": 3,
  "circuit_breaker_timeout_sec": 30,
  "fallback_strategy": "auto_rank"
}
